Aetheria already has a combat specification involving weapon-specific rhythm, combos, parries, poise, hit-stop, reactions, companion assists and Style Rank.

I would expand this into a much deeper combat ecosystem.

Weapon identity

Every weapon should have its own rhythm, advantages, disadvantages and mastery journey.

