2\. Forgotten Knowledge

Ancient knowledge is discovered through exploration, research, historical evidence and experimentation. Players can uncover lost techniques, recipes, spells, architectural secrets and forgotten class disciplines.

![Delicious in Dungeon – Epic Anime Feast HD Wallpaper by rasn | 3000x2100 | Wallpaper Abyss](https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/4_NIuQpD6WT1dAj2xbssmvJEM36wNw4zVP_vDdN3SPXUMD2jAlEfgQ5hZI_VCF8rEyZFrkZj9LP4skcFmflApkUb1eyuMYuRa04D1-hGQXIhs45nQlsusSoBjJ2uL5oAFYJaG-vaBgsTouADNz25wVi5JDxZRXEba8qK6ZiXq5aom-azygrkLNMBplKhceOB?purpose=fullsize)

3\. The Journey System

Travelling itself becomes gameplay. Companions talk, discover things, share stories, argue, request stops and react to the environment. Expeditions become memorable experiences rather than loading screens between quests.

